WEBVTT

1
00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.024
Name Gan-nan.

2
00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:58.424
Wanted on charged of kidnapping,

3
00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.132
blackmail and murder.

4
00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:07.199
Bounty expiration in ten days.
Bounty amount...

5
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.611
500 nyang!

6
00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:26.518
Easy money!
What do you win for a correct guess?

7
00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:30.222
How much...
Double...

8
00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:33.025
Get this one right
and you won't need to plow next year.

9
00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:35.734
Here we go. Place your bets!

10
00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:40.099
Aren't you going to bet?

11
00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.400
I should, shouldn't I?

12
00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:45.003
Which one should I go for?

13
00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:48.006
What do you think?
I can't tell you that!

14
00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.709
What do you think?

15
00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.912
Quit stalling and make your bets.

16
00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:57.916
No, I shouldn't...

17
00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.419
Right, Gan-nan?

18
00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:03.021
Surprised?

19
00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:05.935
You idiot, witch!

20
00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:10.631
Let's not create a scene.

21
00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:14.202
Hold it.

22
00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:19.705
Long time no see, Jin-ok.

23
00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:22.307
Don't bother with hello's.

24
00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:25.410
How you been, darling?

25
00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:28.113
You've got to be kidding me.

26
00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:31.617
I don't want any trouble. Just go your way.

27
00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:35.020
You got to share good things

28
00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:37.823
or none of us can have it.

29
00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:42.528
Think it over. 1,000
nyang is a lot of money.

30
00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:44.229
What?

31
00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:46.532
It's not 500 nyang?

32
00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:49.501
Do I look like a 500 to you?

33
00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:52.004
Your beloved master
must have kept some for himself.

34
00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:54.907
And not only 100 nyang or 200 nyang,

35
00:02:54.908 --> 00:02:57.013
<i>but a whole 500 nyang?</i>

36
00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:00.913
He's getting away.

37
00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:02.621
Get him...

38
00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:11.525
Hey, Gan-nan. Get him!

39
00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:21.200
Hop on.
What?

40
00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:22.901
If you want to live, hop on.

41
00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.002
What did you say?

42
00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:26.415
What are you, a deaf?

43
00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:40.825
What the heck is that?

44
00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:49.228
Shall we start?
That's cute.

45
00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:50.529
<i>What the...</i>

46
00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:51.736
Get that witch...

47
00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:07.120
All attack!

48
00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.031
<i>Idiots...</i>

49
00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:27.511
Surround her!

50
00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:32.104
Ga-bi!

51
00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:34.206
Over here.

52
00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:35.311
Wave!

53
00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:18.919
Get her...

54
00:05:31.931 --> 00:05:33.899
Don't panic.

55
00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:35.902
Everybody, stay calm.

56
00:05:38.905 --> 00:05:41.818
Get ready.

57
00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.620
Here she comes.

58
00:05:49.916 --> 00:05:51.516
Adios for now.

59
00:05:51.517 --> 00:05:54.119
Have a good day.

60
00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.531
What?

61
00:05:58.424 --> 00:06:02.429
Don't miss this one for the sake of Jin-ok.

62
00:06:49.509 --> 00:06:52.820
"THE HUNTRESSES"

63
00:06:56.716 --> 00:06:57.616
Come here, you.

64
00:06:57.617 --> 00:06:58.617
I said I was sorry.

65
00:06:58.618 --> 00:06:59.918
It won't happen again, all right?

66
00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:02.921
Well, it's happened too many time already.

67
00:07:02.922 --> 00:07:04.823
Where's the other 500 nyang?

68
00:07:04.824 --> 00:07:06.224
Ga-bi, will you calm her down?

69
00:07:06.225 --> 00:07:07.726
She has the crazy eyes again.

70
00:07:07.727 --> 00:07:11.129
It's not her eyes. She's
just plain psychotic.

71
00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:13.131
Give her the money before she kills you.

72
00:07:13.132 --> 00:07:16.101
Hey, you're not helping.
Give me the money, now!

73
00:07:16.102 --> 00:07:18.412
Gather up, everyone...

74
00:07:20.006 --> 00:07:21.606
This is something serious, isn't it?

75
00:07:21.607 --> 00:07:23.308
Definitely something dangerous.

76
00:07:23.309 --> 00:07:25.010
I'd better be going then.

77
00:07:25.011 --> 00:07:27.321
It's nothing like that.

78
00:07:32.018 --> 00:07:33.919
That's just a bearing ball.

79
00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:34.920
A bearing ball?

80
00:07:34.921 --> 00:07:38.926
Only that it isn't an any old bearing ball.

81
00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:41.326
It's an any old bearing ball...

82
00:07:41.327 --> 00:07:42.635
Oh, come on!

83
00:08:00.813 --> 00:08:03.114
It's just a waterwheel.

84
00:08:03.115 --> 00:08:05.220
Or is it?

85
00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:14.025
Are you in trouble again?
Let go of this and tell me.

86
00:08:14.026 --> 00:08:16.028
Where are you?
Turn the light back on.

87
00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.831
Anyone tries to infiltrate,

88
00:08:19.832 --> 00:08:22.100
and these walls will come down.

89
00:08:22.101 --> 00:08:23.802
That can withstand arrows,

90
00:08:23.803 --> 00:08:26.505
matchlocks and most artilleries.

91
00:08:26.506 --> 00:08:28.907
That's my girl. Well done!

92
00:08:28.908 --> 00:08:32.010
I feel so much safer now.

93
00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:33.111
Stop it.

94
00:08:33.112 --> 00:08:34.513
Okay... let's go out for lunch.

95
00:08:34.514 --> 00:08:38.016
It feels quite claustrophobic in here.

96
00:08:38.017 --> 00:08:39.017
Put them back up.

97
00:08:39.018 --> 00:08:40.819
I need to go about an urgent matter.

98
00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:43.522
To hit the can?

99
00:08:43.523 --> 00:08:47.826
Come on. The girl says she has to go.

100
00:08:47.827 --> 00:08:49.828
I haven't installed an
opening mechanism yet.

101
00:08:49.829 --> 00:08:51.429
Does that mean we can't get out?

102
00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:54.502
We could open it manually.

103
00:08:56.202 --> 00:08:57.502
This will keep us safe?

104
00:08:57.503 --> 00:08:58.603
You're the biggest hazard to us.

105
00:08:58.604 --> 00:09:00.805
Come on, let's get us out of here.

106
00:09:00.806 --> 00:09:03.808
One, two, three!

107
00:09:03.809 --> 00:09:05.310
Can you make some effort?

108
00:09:05.311 --> 00:09:06.511
Was it 'on' three?

109
00:09:06.512 --> 00:09:07.913
No, it's after three.

110
00:09:07.914 --> 00:09:09.014
But he says it's on three.

111
00:09:09.015 --> 00:09:10.115
Nobody lifts on three!

112
00:09:10.116 --> 00:09:12.918
Whether it's 'on' three or 'after'

113
00:09:12.919 --> 00:09:14.219
you got to put in some muscle power.

114
00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:18.225
It doesn't matter if you count till 100.

115
00:09:18.324 --> 00:09:20.025
Come on, everyone! After three, then.

116
00:09:20.026 --> 00:09:21.826
All right.

117
00:09:21.827 --> 00:09:24.129
<i>One, two...</i>

118
00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.632
Three!

119
00:09:26.799 --> 00:09:28.199
Darn it!
Get out of the way.

120
00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:31.002
This darn hole of a house!

121
00:09:31.003 --> 00:09:32.203
Easy! You'll hurt yourself.

122
00:09:32.204 --> 00:09:34.411
Yeah, just tear it all down this old house.

123
00:09:58.831 --> 00:10:03.803
You must get to His Majesty...

124
00:10:37.103 --> 00:10:39.104
There is another one.

125
00:10:39.105 --> 00:10:40.105
Find him!

126
00:10:40.106 --> 00:10:41.107
Yes, sir...

127
00:10:49.215 --> 00:10:51.816
Did you retrieve the stauroscope?

128
00:10:51.817 --> 00:10:55.320
It had already left him by
the time we got to him.

129
00:10:55.321 --> 00:10:58.623
There was another secret envoy?

130
00:10:58.624 --> 00:11:00.934
We chased the other one but...

131
00:11:02.628 --> 00:11:04.629
Apologies, my lord.

132
00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.531
I won't hear of it.

133
00:11:06.532 --> 00:11:11.202
Bring me the stauroscope at all cost.

134
00:11:11.203 --> 00:11:14.906
You must repay my kindness.

135
00:11:14.907 --> 00:11:17.820
Isn't that right, Sa-hyeon?

136
00:11:20.513 --> 00:11:23.615
The number of secret envoys
assassinated to date is seven.

137
00:11:23.616 --> 00:11:25.016
They were all killed just a day before

138
00:11:25.017 --> 00:11:27.318
they were due to meet His Majesty.

139
00:11:27.319 --> 00:11:30.822
The only one surviving is Gong-gu.

140
00:11:30.823 --> 00:11:34.626
I'm afraid the stauroscope
will be lost forever.

141
00:11:34.627 --> 00:11:39.627
We can't just sit around
and wait for him to show.

142
00:11:39.932 --> 00:11:41.800
We mush look for him ourselves.

143
00:11:41.801 --> 00:11:45.806
But since we cannot ascertain
who's colluding with the enemies,

144
00:11:46.005 --> 00:11:51.005
the risk is far too great to use our men.

145
00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:53.912
I have a proposition.

146
00:11:53.913 --> 00:11:57.918
Have you heard of a man called Mu Myeong?

147
00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:06.120
I hear that you are responsible
for 60% of all successful bounties.

148
00:12:06.125 --> 00:12:10.628
You heard wrong, sir. It's 70%.

149
00:12:10.629 --> 00:12:14.509
His name is Gong-gu. A bandit leader.

150
00:12:16.702 --> 00:12:18.203
What are you doing?

151
00:12:18.204 --> 00:12:21.306
Having fun eavesdropping?

152
00:12:21.307 --> 00:12:23.913
This is how you do it.

153
00:12:25.711 --> 00:12:28.313
He has tattooed 'Number 9'
in Chinese character of the neck.

154
00:12:28.314 --> 00:12:30.815
So, you want me to find this man?

155
00:12:30.816 --> 00:12:34.119
He also has an article in his possession,

156
00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.521
a thing called stauroscope.

157
00:12:36.522 --> 00:12:38.723
I want the stauroscope, too.

158
00:12:38.724 --> 00:12:42.227
I expect utmost discretion.

159
00:12:42.228 --> 00:12:45.141
The bounty at stake is 10,000 nyang.

160
00:12:48.601 --> 00:12:50.001
I won't take the job.

161
00:12:50.002 --> 00:12:53.006
Why not?

162
00:12:55.908 --> 00:12:58.218
Sorry about that.

163
00:13:04.717 --> 00:13:09.717
Come out, Constable Song...

164
00:13:12.224 --> 00:13:13.424
Sir!

165
00:13:13.425 --> 00:13:15.234
What the heck?

166
00:13:17.129 --> 00:13:20.398
They'll soon be out looking for Gong-gu.

167
00:13:20.399 --> 00:13:23.201
Follow their every move.

168
00:13:23.202 --> 00:13:28.202
Sir, I shall fulfill my duties
as a honorable constable.

169
00:13:28.207 --> 00:13:29.607
Good.

170
00:13:29.608 --> 00:13:31.610
Now, return to your post.

171
00:13:33.312 --> 00:13:35.223
Yes, sir.

172
00:13:49.428 --> 00:13:52.230
Great! I'm out for some air,

173
00:13:52.231 --> 00:13:54.999
and it starts to rain.

174
00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:58.703
I think it's quite lovely.

175
00:13:58.704 --> 00:14:01.506
Lovely?

176
00:14:01.507 --> 00:14:06.211
You obviously never had
your washing soaked in rain before.

177
00:14:06.212 --> 00:14:10.114
You brought it upon yourself
when you got married early.

178
00:14:10.115 --> 00:14:11.616
I know!

179
00:14:11.617 --> 00:14:16.120
You girls stick it out as
long as you can. You hear?

180
00:14:16.121 --> 00:14:19.224
By the way, hasn't your husband
enter into the society yet?

181
00:14:19.225 --> 00:14:21.826
Thanks to his incompetence,

182
00:14:21.827 --> 00:14:25.530
I'm getting all the scolding
from my mother-in-law.

183
00:14:25.531 --> 00:14:28.199
Why don't you make sure
she doesn't say another word?

184
00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:31.703
I could beat her up for you, if you'd like.

185
00:14:31.704 --> 00:14:34.305
My goodness, the way you talk...

186
00:14:34.306 --> 00:14:35.206
Reminds you of her?

187
00:14:35.207 --> 00:14:37.408
Makes me want to puke.

188
00:14:37.409 --> 00:14:39.320
Oh, Lord!

189
00:14:44.917 --> 00:14:48.620
What? Book of Secret Recipes?

190
00:14:48.621 --> 00:14:53.124
So, you'll restore the family fortune
with lowly cooking skills?

191
00:14:53.125 --> 00:14:54.726
You wicked witch!

192
00:14:54.727 --> 00:14:56.527
How can you drag your husband

193
00:14:56.528 --> 00:15:00.498
into doing lowly women's job?

194
00:15:00.499 --> 00:15:03.801
Mother, I never did such a thing.

195
00:15:03.802 --> 00:15:06.104
And, whether lowly or not,

196
00:15:06.105 --> 00:15:07.906
it's what he chooses to do.

197
00:15:07.907 --> 00:15:10.508
Isn't that what matters?

198
00:15:10.509 --> 00:15:12.010
Stop, madam.

199
00:15:12.011 --> 00:15:13.912
You mustn't talk like that.

200
00:15:13.913 --> 00:15:17.916
How dare you talk back to me,

201
00:15:17.917 --> 00:15:20.418
you silly lowly girl!

202
00:15:20.419 --> 00:15:22.420
A lowly girl?

203
00:15:22.421 --> 00:15:24.722
Aren't you a woman yourself?

204
00:15:24.723 --> 00:15:28.728
What about your mother and her mother?

205
00:15:28.928 --> 00:15:30.228
And guess what?

206
00:15:30.229 --> 00:15:32.931
Your dearly treasured son,

207
00:15:32.932 --> 00:15:35.099
was given birth by you, a woman!

208
00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:36.401
Good heavens...

209
00:15:36.402 --> 00:15:38.503
Mother!

210
00:15:38.504 --> 00:15:42.307
This is why they say you must

211
00:15:42.308 --> 00:15:45.414
find a wife from good roots.

212
00:15:47.112 --> 00:15:49.914
Get out of my house now!

213
00:15:49.915 --> 00:15:50.815
Mother!

214
00:15:50.816 --> 00:15:54.218
Who are you calling a mother?
Leave this house at once!

215
00:15:54.219 --> 00:15:56.028
Hong-dan!

216
00:15:57.723 --> 00:15:59.524
Good afternoon, madam.

217
00:15:59.525 --> 00:16:03.029
<i>I'm a friend Hong-dan's.</i>

218
00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:08.299
This mirror is from Qing China.

219
00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:10.101
And this hairpin...

220
00:16:10.102 --> 00:16:12.003
Let me guess. From Vietnam?

221
00:16:12.004 --> 00:16:13.104
Or Samra?

222
00:16:13.105 --> 00:16:17.110
Samra is the correct answer.

223
00:16:17.209 --> 00:16:20.912
What did you want to see
my daughter-in-law for?

224
00:16:20.913 --> 00:16:23.915
You haven't told your mother yet?

225
00:16:23.916 --> 00:16:26.117
Tell her what?

226
00:16:26.118 --> 00:16:29.921
First of all, show her the hairpins.

227
00:16:29.922 --> 00:16:31.823
My hairpins?

228
00:16:31.824 --> 00:16:33.224
What are you trying to do?

229
00:16:33.225 --> 00:16:37.640
It's okay. Just show her.

230
00:16:39.531 --> 00:16:42.011
Oh, dear...

231
00:16:49.008 --> 00:16:51.614
What in God's name are you doing?

232
00:17:08.927 --> 00:17:10.828
Here. Have a drink.

233
00:17:10.829 --> 00:17:14.402
Now, this is your
daughter-in-law's specialty.

234
00:17:26.712 --> 00:17:31.616
Isn't it delightful to see
what she is capable of?

235
00:17:31.617 --> 00:17:33.918
Sure...
I ask of you

236
00:17:33.919 --> 00:17:37.422
to give her good guidance.

237
00:17:37.423 --> 00:17:43.135
Please don't...

238
00:17:46.331 --> 00:17:48.199
One poster per person

239
00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:50.902
and one bundle of coins each.

240
00:17:50.903 --> 00:17:54.705
Now listen carefully.

241
00:17:54.706 --> 00:17:56.707
<i>Okay...</i>

242
00:17:56.708 --> 00:17:58.709
As you see in the poster,

243
00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:00.812
the wanted man's name is Gong-gu.

244
00:18:00.813 --> 00:18:02.713
Gong-gu...
That's right.

245
00:18:02.714 --> 00:18:06.417
He has a tattoo on the back of the neck.

246
00:18:06.418 --> 00:18:08.119
Listen.

247
00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:13.120
'Gu' like number 9, not like mouth.

248
00:18:13.225 --> 00:18:16.035
Gu like number 9.

249
00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:21.803
Number 9 in the back of the neck, it is.

250
00:18:25.404 --> 00:18:29.006
Did you really find out
where Gong-gu is hiding out?

251
00:18:29.007 --> 00:18:30.408
That's right.

252
00:18:30.409 --> 00:18:32.810
Way to go, girl!

253
00:18:32.811 --> 00:18:36.816
You're better off
without the master who rips us off.

254
00:18:47.826 --> 00:18:49.727
Where did they go?

255
00:18:49.728 --> 00:18:51.529
You!
Who are you?

256
00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:52.730
Why are you following us?

257
00:18:52.731 --> 00:18:54.799
You could see me?
Who are you?

258
00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:56.501
Who the heck?
Your identity.

259
00:18:56.502 --> 00:18:58.402
I can't be visible.

260
00:18:58.403 --> 00:19:00.204
You've been following us.

261
00:19:00.205 --> 00:19:01.806
Why did you follow us?
The reason!

262
00:19:01.807 --> 00:19:04.408
Do you practice that?

263
00:19:04.409 --> 00:19:09.415
Taking turns to talk like that?

264
00:19:11.116 --> 00:19:15.119
Fine! I'll tell you.

265
00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:17.421
Where do I start...

266
00:19:17.422 --> 00:19:21.125
Have you heard of the Department of Seoul?

267
00:19:21.126 --> 00:19:22.026
In that department, my duty is to...

268
00:19:22.027 --> 00:19:24.128
Take care of him, will ya?

269
00:19:24.129 --> 00:19:25.930
We got to move on.

270
00:19:25.931 --> 00:19:28.099
Just bury him somewhere. I'm hungry.

271
00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:32.103
All right. Order a beef stew for me.

272
00:19:32.104 --> 00:19:34.005
Who do you think you are?

273
00:19:34.006 --> 00:19:35.815
You asked me a question...

274
00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:43.810
Why are you looking at me like that?

275
00:19:44.416 --> 00:19:47.818
What a curious joker!

276
00:19:47.819 --> 00:19:49.320
You clueless witches!

277
00:19:49.321 --> 00:19:51.631
How dare you, in presence of a man...

278
00:20:00.799 --> 00:20:04.001
You know how to punch for a girl.

279
00:20:04.002 --> 00:20:07.609
Hey, come back here.

280
00:20:09.508 --> 00:20:11.818
Hey! Slow down.

281
00:20:14.313 --> 00:20:16.919
<i>You...
What?</i>

282
00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:26.530
I knew it. You're not a woman.

283
00:20:39.204 --> 00:20:41.105
Go home.

284
00:20:41.106 --> 00:20:42.607
If you follow us again,
I'll kill you for real.

285
00:20:42.608 --> 00:20:45.418
<i>Okay...</i>

286
00:20:49.414 --> 00:20:54.414
It feels different to hit this one.

287
00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:56.822
How curious!

288
00:21:13.805 --> 00:21:16.217
There you are.
Who are you people?

289
00:21:20.912 --> 00:21:23.514
Where are the girls?

290
00:21:23.515 --> 00:21:26.317
What you doing in my house
without my permission?

291
00:21:26.318 --> 00:21:28.219
I hear you're looking for this man.

292
00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.121
Where is the girls now?

293
00:21:30.122 --> 00:21:32.124
I don't know what you're talking about.

294
00:21:34.326 --> 00:21:35.526
Where did the girls go?

295
00:21:35.527 --> 00:21:37.728
What... what if I don't tell you?

296
00:21:37.729 --> 00:21:39.630
Are you going to kill me?

297
00:21:39.631 --> 00:21:42.305
Not until you tell me.

298
00:21:43.302 --> 00:21:45.403
Who are you to talk to me this way?

299
00:21:45.404 --> 00:21:46.604
You see the wick burning?

300
00:21:46.605 --> 00:21:49.307
It never goes off once it's lit.

301
00:21:49.308 --> 00:21:50.908
So, unless you want to
meet your fate here...

302
00:21:50.909 --> 00:21:52.911
That's not supposed to happen.

303
00:21:56.014 --> 00:21:59.317
God...

304
00:21:59.318 --> 00:22:01.719
I ask for the last time.

305
00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:04.522
Where are the girls?

306
00:22:04.523 --> 00:22:07.525
They went to the market
because it's a market day.

307
00:22:07.526 --> 00:22:10.439
Girls like markets, don't they all?

308
00:22:17.002 --> 00:22:18.803
So? Is he there?

309
00:22:18.804 --> 00:22:22.406
They all look alike. It's
hard to tell from a poster.

310
00:22:22.407 --> 00:22:25.309
It's not easy to single out

311
00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:27.912
someone you've never met.

312
00:22:27.913 --> 00:22:30.815
What do we do now?
What do you mean, what?

313
00:22:30.816 --> 00:22:32.523
Gather around.

314
00:22:38.924 --> 00:22:41.530
Attention, please!

315
00:22:43.328 --> 00:22:44.929
His name is Gong-gu.

316
00:22:44.930 --> 00:22:46.230
Gu, not like 'mouth'

317
00:22:46.231 --> 00:22:49.700
but like 'number 9' tattooed
in the back of the neck.

318
00:22:49.701 --> 00:22:52.002
Raise your hand, if you think

319
00:22:52.003 --> 00:22:53.404
you're the man I'm looking for.

320
00:22:53.405 --> 00:22:58.411
Come on, a little cooperation here?

321
00:23:00.312 --> 00:23:02.012
Gong-gu!

322
00:23:02.013 --> 00:23:04.220
You're Mr. Gong-gu, right?

323
00:23:06.118 --> 00:23:08.219
Follow us quietly.

324
00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:10.621
Who sent you?

325
00:23:10.622 --> 00:23:12.123
Was it Kim Ja-heon?

326
00:23:12.124 --> 00:23:13.224
Who?

327
00:23:13.225 --> 00:23:16.727
It doesn't matter who.

328
00:23:16.728 --> 00:23:18.729
If you want to take me away,

329
00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:19.997
you'll have to kill me.

330
00:23:19.998 --> 00:23:22.400
Hello, you sneaky rat!

331
00:23:22.401 --> 00:23:27.612
You were lucky to get away last time
but not today.

332
00:23:29.808 --> 00:23:32.109
Who the heck are you?

333
00:23:32.110 --> 00:23:33.711
Hello, pretty-face!

334
00:23:33.712 --> 00:23:36.013
Which house you from?

335
00:23:36.014 --> 00:23:37.114
What?

336
00:23:37.115 --> 00:23:40.317
Which whorehouse you work for?

337
00:23:40.318 --> 00:23:42.119
<i>What the...</i>

338
00:23:42.120 --> 00:23:43.821
I'll pretend I didn't hear that.

339
00:23:43.822 --> 00:23:45.423
Walk away.

340
00:23:45.424 --> 00:23:46.424
What the heck?

341
00:23:46.425 --> 00:23:48.325
What's wrong with that one-eye?

342
00:23:48.326 --> 00:23:50.728
What did you call me,

343
00:23:50.729 --> 00:23:53.335
you clueless little witch?

344
00:23:55.100 --> 00:23:57.301
Hey, we can always talk things out.

345
00:23:57.302 --> 00:23:59.403
You weren't sent by Kim Ja-heon?

346
00:23:59.404 --> 00:24:02.606
We're here at the request
of the Chief of Police.

347
00:24:02.607 --> 00:24:05.509
The Chief of Police?

348
00:24:05.510 --> 00:24:08.218
Why didn't you say so?

349
00:24:10.415 --> 00:24:11.515
<i>What the...</i>

350
00:24:11.516 --> 00:24:13.818
Gosh, I'm missing a tooth.

351
00:24:13.819 --> 00:24:15.719
Ready?

352
00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:17.421
Why are you doing?

353
00:24:17.422 --> 00:24:19.333
Get that man!

354
00:24:32.003 --> 00:24:34.205
Get those witches!

355
00:24:34.206 --> 00:24:36.015
You heard him.

356
00:24:38.510 --> 00:24:40.211
This is going to be a mess.

357
00:24:40.212 --> 00:24:43.113
Mr. Gong-gu, you must stay close to me.

358
00:24:43.114 --> 00:24:44.315
Okay.

359
00:24:44.316 --> 00:24:46.227
Don't stand behind me.

360
00:24:49.921 --> 00:24:52.423
This isn't going to work.

361
00:24:52.424 --> 00:24:53.824
Let's split and meet back.

362
00:24:53.825 --> 00:24:56.026
Meet back where?

363
00:24:56.027 --> 00:24:57.938
Just split first!

364
00:25:23.522 --> 00:25:25.627
Bring it on, scumbags!

365
00:25:38.603 --> 00:25:41.015
Stay behind me! Behind me!

366
00:25:47.913 --> 00:25:50.314
Back off! Didn't you hear me?

367
00:25:50.315 --> 00:25:52.016
What are you doing there?

368
00:25:52.017 --> 00:25:53.117
Do something.

369
00:25:53.118 --> 00:25:55.119
What could I do? Jump!

370
00:25:55.120 --> 00:25:56.724
What?

371
00:26:04.829 --> 00:26:05.933
Jump?

372
00:26:08.800 --> 00:26:10.801
I can make it.

373
00:26:10.802 --> 00:26:13.003
I can make the jump.

374
00:26:13.004 --> 00:26:15.006
I made it...

375
00:26:19.210 --> 00:26:20.211
Darn it, I broke it.

376
00:26:44.202 --> 00:26:47.004
Jin-ok!

377
00:26:47.005 --> 00:26:50.418
Ga-bi! Hong-dan...

378
00:27:06.324 --> 00:27:08.133
Search for them.

379
00:27:54.906 --> 00:27:56.817
Freeze.

380
00:27:59.210 --> 00:28:01.111
Don't make a move

381
00:28:01.112 --> 00:28:05.716
or I'll blow your head off.

382
00:28:05.717 --> 00:28:08.419
I said not a move.

383
00:28:08.420 --> 00:28:10.320
Tell me.

384
00:28:10.321 --> 00:28:13.427
Why did you kill Gong-gu?

385
00:28:18.329 --> 00:28:20.998
Turn around and face me.

386
00:28:20.999 --> 00:28:23.206
Look at me.

387
00:28:31.309 --> 00:28:33.812
Let me go!

388
00:28:38.316 --> 00:28:40.523
Go, miss! Hurry!

389
00:29:31.202 --> 00:29:35.105
The King is such a reckless man.

390
00:29:35.106 --> 00:29:39.409
He tried to build the military map

391
00:29:39.410 --> 00:29:43.415
of the Great Qing Emperor's army?

392
00:29:44.916 --> 00:29:48.919
All I have to do is to hand over
this stauroscope to the Qing envoy

393
00:29:48.920 --> 00:29:52.925
and this kingdom will be mine.

394
00:30:37.001 --> 00:30:39.503
Has it been 10 years?

395
00:30:39.504 --> 00:30:43.907
No, it's been more.

396
00:30:43.908 --> 00:30:51.622
Stay alive a little longer.

397
00:30:55.720 --> 00:30:58.422
Nothing can go happen

398
00:30:58.423 --> 00:31:01.124
until the Qing envoys arrive.

399
00:31:01.125 --> 00:31:02.326
Yes, my lord.

400
00:31:02.327 --> 00:31:04.328
The only worry is

401
00:31:04.329 --> 00:31:06.797
that he might try to kill himself again.

402
00:31:06.798 --> 00:31:12.111
Keep reminding him that
we're holding his daughter hostage.

403
00:31:14.005 --> 00:31:19.005
That's the only way to keep him alive.

404
00:31:19.611 --> 00:31:24.822
You can never let him die.

405
00:31:30.922 --> 00:31:34.625
It all happened because of me, master.

406
00:31:34.626 --> 00:31:35.826
Please punish me.

407
00:31:35.827 --> 00:31:39.229
She's right. If it wasn't for her...

408
00:31:39.230 --> 00:31:40.797
But it's true.

409
00:31:40.798 --> 00:31:45.302
I'll take any punishment you give me.

410
00:31:45.303 --> 00:31:49.308
But before that, tell me who Gong-gu was.

411
00:31:49.407 --> 00:31:51.708
How am I supposed to know that?

412
00:31:51.709 --> 00:31:53.410
I don't know him.

413
00:31:53.411 --> 00:31:57.114
You've been tracking his trail.

414
00:31:57.115 --> 00:31:59.917
I was there that day.

415
00:31:59.918 --> 00:32:02.219
You were?

416
00:32:02.220 --> 00:32:03.620
How I come I never saw you?

417
00:32:03.621 --> 00:32:06.223
You weren't trying to keep
whole 10,000 nyang to yourself?

418
00:32:06.224 --> 00:32:08.625
I don't think so.

419
00:32:08.626 --> 00:32:10.427
It's not like that at all.

420
00:32:10.428 --> 00:32:13.030
It really doesn't concern you.

421
00:32:13.031 --> 00:32:15.399
You got to believe me.

422
00:32:15.400 --> 00:32:16.700
Liar.
Crook.

423
00:32:16.701 --> 00:32:18.201
It's a habit.
Like he always has done.

424
00:32:18.202 --> 00:32:20.604
How dare you rebel against
your honored master?

425
00:32:20.605 --> 00:32:24.610
We tried to do good
and ended up losing all the money.

426
00:32:24.709 --> 00:32:27.622
I know nothing about it.

427
00:32:31.716 --> 00:32:33.116
He leaves me with no choice.

428
00:32:33.117 --> 00:32:36.420
Get me my sword.
Your sword?

429
00:32:36.421 --> 00:32:41.325
I really wasn't going to tell you
but I will just once.

430
00:32:41.326 --> 00:32:43.927
So, listen carefully. And no questions.

431
00:32:43.928 --> 00:32:45.028
Okay.

432
00:32:45.029 --> 00:32:47.397
You remember about

433
00:32:47.398 --> 00:32:52.398
the war between this country
and the Qing Dynasty.

434
00:32:52.503 --> 00:32:54.004
As the result of defeat,

435
00:32:54.005 --> 00:32:57.207
our Crown Prince was taken hostage by Qing.

436
00:32:57.208 --> 00:33:01.011
This country! The humiliation!

437
00:33:01.012 --> 00:33:03.714
And 10 years on...

438
00:33:03.715 --> 00:33:06.116
The Prince! The King!

439
00:33:06.117 --> 00:33:07.818
The expedition to conquer the north!

440
00:33:07.819 --> 00:33:10.620
Sir Gong-gu was at the center of it all.

441
00:33:10.621 --> 00:33:13.623
And that stauroscope was the vital basis.

442
00:33:13.624 --> 00:33:16.526
So, the King tried... but failed.

443
00:33:16.527 --> 00:33:19.629
And it all ended up like this.

444
00:33:19.630 --> 00:33:21.610
Do you understand?

445
00:33:24.002 --> 00:33:27.204
You don't understand?
Should I explain again?

446
00:33:27.205 --> 00:33:28.405
Long time ago...

447
00:33:28.406 --> 00:33:33.010
So, Gong-gu was King's secret envoy

448
00:33:33.011 --> 00:33:38.011
and his mission was to pass
the stauroscope to the King.

449
00:33:38.116 --> 00:33:40.617
But we had no idea what was going on.

450
00:33:40.618 --> 00:33:43.220
We just had to find the man

451
00:33:43.221 --> 00:33:45.822
and get the reward from
the Chief of Police.

452
00:33:45.823 --> 00:33:49.026
Then, the one-eye's men attacked us

453
00:33:49.027 --> 00:33:51.528
and the man from the reeds field
showed up from out of nowhere

454
00:33:51.529 --> 00:33:53.597
and Gong-gu was killed in
the middle of all that.

455
00:33:53.598 --> 00:33:56.800
They took the stauroscope from me.

456
00:33:56.801 --> 00:33:58.001
So, we can't get our reward

457
00:33:58.002 --> 00:34:00.203
and ended up in this situation.

458
00:34:00.204 --> 00:34:02.115
That's it?

459
00:34:13.217 --> 00:34:16.620
Murderers, surrender now.
Come out to be bound.

460
00:34:16.621 --> 00:34:18.422
Murderers? Us?

461
00:34:18.423 --> 00:34:20.023
They're accusing us of killing Sir Gong-gu.

462
00:34:20.024 --> 00:34:21.525
But it wasn't us!

463
00:34:21.526 --> 00:34:23.126
It was the man that fought with Jin-ok.

464
00:34:23.127 --> 00:34:24.928
Who would believe that?

465
00:34:24.929 --> 00:34:26.533
Looks like we're going down for it.

466
00:34:34.405 --> 00:34:35.713
<i>Shoot!</i>

467
00:34:43.614 --> 00:34:44.422
What's that?

468
00:34:45.817 --> 00:34:48.618
This tunnel connects to the river.

469
00:34:48.619 --> 00:34:50.720
That's wonderful!

470
00:34:50.721 --> 00:34:51.922
Wait.

471
00:34:51.923 --> 00:34:54.424
Please stay behind for us.

472
00:34:54.425 --> 00:34:56.426
Let us get away first.

473
00:34:56.427 --> 00:34:57.828
What are you talking about?
We should stick together.

474
00:34:57.829 --> 00:34:59.629
Think about it.

475
00:34:59.630 --> 00:35:01.398
If we run away together,

476
00:35:01.399 --> 00:35:04.501
the troops will come right after us.

477
00:35:04.502 --> 00:35:06.903
If we get caught by chance,

478
00:35:06.904 --> 00:35:09.606
then, we'll be hanged
without a chance to clear our names.

479
00:35:09.607 --> 00:35:11.712
We can't let that happen...

480
00:35:20.218 --> 00:35:22.219
Master.
Yes, Ga-bi.

481
00:35:22.220 --> 00:35:24.325
I think I should go.

482
00:35:28.326 --> 00:35:30.026
Hong-dan!

483
00:35:30.027 --> 00:35:31.228
Hey, Jin-ok...

484
00:35:31.229 --> 00:35:32.833
Yes?

485
00:35:35.399 --> 00:35:39.402
It doesn't feel right to let
you go by yourselves...

486
00:35:39.403 --> 00:35:40.504
Why don't we just go together?

487
00:35:40.505 --> 00:35:41.805
Don't even think about it.

488
00:35:41.806 --> 00:35:45.208
Come on! How can you do this to me?

489
00:35:45.209 --> 00:35:47.410
Wait for us.

490
00:35:47.411 --> 00:35:49.212
I'll do right, I promise.

491
00:35:49.213 --> 00:35:51.214
You're sure?

492
00:35:51.215 --> 00:35:53.116
Long and happy life, master.

493
00:35:53.117 --> 00:35:56.326
Long and happy life...

494
00:35:58.823 --> 00:36:00.928
You ungrateful witches!

495
00:36:07.798 --> 00:36:12.798
Here comes Mu Myeong, the fearless warrior!

496
00:36:12.803 --> 00:36:15.215
Bring it on if you dare.

497
00:36:17.208 --> 00:36:18.312
<i>Shoot!</i>

498
00:36:19.410 --> 00:36:21.411
Keep shooting at me. I won't blink an eye.

499
00:36:21.412 --> 00:36:24.614
Keep shooting.
Bring it on, jerks.

500
00:36:24.615 --> 00:36:27.221
Aim for the head!
With arrows like these?

501
00:36:44.902 --> 00:36:48.205
I told you! It wasn't me but the girls.

502
00:36:48.206 --> 00:36:51.508
Who do you report to?

503
00:36:51.509 --> 00:36:54.711
I'll make you pay
when I get out of here, scumbags!

504
00:36:54.712 --> 00:36:57.318
Is that you, Master Mu Myeong?

505
00:37:00.718 --> 00:37:02.129
Do I know you?

506
00:37:03.921 --> 00:37:06.423
What's wrong with you?

507
00:37:06.424 --> 00:37:07.724
You're asking us?

508
00:37:07.725 --> 00:37:09.626
I'll skin you alive.

509
00:37:09.627 --> 00:37:12.335
Ask Jin-ok. She'll tell you.

510
00:37:16.901 --> 00:37:19.202
Jin-ok! Hong-dan!

511
00:37:19.203 --> 00:37:21.205
Ga-bi!

512
00:37:29.413 --> 00:37:32.916
Keep an eye on Jo Yu-sik.

513
00:37:32.917 --> 00:37:35.919
He'll come useful very soon.

514
00:37:35.920 --> 00:37:39.623
Yes, my lord.

515
00:37:39.624 --> 00:37:41.625
<i>But...</i>

516
00:37:41.626 --> 00:37:44.027
Why are you keeping him alive

517
00:37:44.028 --> 00:37:47.999
when all the other envoys are taken out?

518
00:37:49.700 --> 00:37:53.703
The stauroscope the King
had the secret envoys made

519
00:37:53.704 --> 00:37:57.707
contains the military map of Qing.

520
00:37:57.708 --> 00:38:02.708
Even if we take the stauroscope
to the Qing Emperor,

521
00:38:02.813 --> 00:38:06.116
there is nothing the Emperor can do

522
00:38:06.117 --> 00:38:10.122
if we can't prove that our
King commissioned it.

523
00:38:10.321 --> 00:38:15.321
That's why I'm keeping
Jo Yu-sik alive because he lead

524
00:38:15.826 --> 00:38:20.397
and executed the King's secret mission.

525
00:38:20.398 --> 00:38:25.398
What made you curious about it?

526
00:38:27.004 --> 00:38:30.507
He's been kept in custody
for over 10 years.

527
00:38:30.508 --> 00:38:34.210
I wondered if he is worth all
that trouble, that's all.

528
00:38:34.211 --> 00:38:37.420
Just out of curiosity?

529
00:39:13.818 --> 00:39:15.422
Who's there?

530
00:39:32.603 --> 00:39:34.404
Secret warehouse.

531
00:39:34.405 --> 00:39:36.612
I think we found it.

532
00:39:53.524 --> 00:39:56.226
You can't have imagined
that I would follow you here.

533
00:39:56.227 --> 00:39:59.231
Wherever you go, you're
on the palm of my hand.

534
00:40:11.409 --> 00:40:13.616
Where are they hiding it?

535
00:40:19.717 --> 00:40:24.020
Ga-bi, I found it.

536
00:40:24.021 --> 00:40:26.923
It looks as precious as it's worth.

537
00:40:26.924 --> 00:40:28.232
Let's get out of here.

538
00:40:32.329 --> 00:40:34.900
Hong-dan, we got it.

539
00:40:39.603 --> 00:40:42.705
What are you doing? Let's go.

540
00:40:42.706 --> 00:40:45.208
Put it back.

541
00:40:45.209 --> 00:40:47.211
Where it was.

542
00:40:58.222 --> 00:41:01.024
Who the heck is that?
Who are you?

543
00:41:01.025 --> 00:41:02.936
Where do you think you're going?

544
00:41:05.529 --> 00:41:06.796
Well...
You?

545
00:41:06.797 --> 00:41:07.597
What happened was...

546
00:41:07.598 --> 00:41:09.999
You're really begging to
have your life taken away.

547
00:41:10.000 --> 00:41:12.913
If that's what you want...

548
00:41:17.007 --> 00:41:19.709
I'll take off. Don't be too long.

549
00:41:19.710 --> 00:41:21.010
Sure.

550
00:41:21.011 --> 00:41:22.111
Excuse me...

551
00:41:22.112 --> 00:41:24.114
What the heck?

552
00:41:39.830 --> 00:41:40.697
Jin-ok!

553
00:41:40.698 --> 00:41:42.298
Tell me.

554
00:41:42.299 --> 00:41:43.199
Where is it?

555
00:41:43.200 --> 00:41:45.111
Father!

556
00:41:46.704 --> 00:41:50.507
How dare you?

557
00:41:50.508 --> 00:41:52.108
Get her!

558
00:41:52.109 --> 00:41:53.918
Yes, sir...

559
00:41:59.617 --> 00:42:01.317
What's wrong with you?

560
00:42:01.318 --> 00:42:03.127
Let's get out of here.

561
00:42:09.126 --> 00:42:10.627
Get them!

562
00:42:10.628 --> 00:42:12.829
You can never let them get away.

563
00:42:12.830 --> 00:42:16.107
<i>Get them...</i>

564
00:42:24.808 --> 00:42:27.710
They're coming straight this way.

565
00:42:27.711 --> 00:42:29.312
What are you going to do?

566
00:42:29.313 --> 00:42:32.115
What choice do we have?

567
00:42:32.116 --> 00:42:33.720
Over there.

568
00:42:37.922 --> 00:42:41.724
I know I'll die early because of her.

569
00:42:41.725 --> 00:42:44.433
Get going. We'll meet back at home.

570
00:42:47.197 --> 00:42:48.598
I'm sorry.

571
00:42:48.599 --> 00:42:51.000
Cut the crap and go.

572
00:42:51.001 --> 00:42:53.208
Be careful, okay?

573
00:42:56.807 --> 00:42:58.408
Hey, you jerks!

574
00:42:58.409 --> 00:43:00.218
Here I am.

575
00:43:04.114 --> 00:43:05.214
You didn't take off?

576
00:43:05.215 --> 00:43:06.816
That's curious.

577
00:43:06.817 --> 00:43:09.919
I don't take off just any time.

578
00:43:09.920 --> 00:43:11.331
Now might be a good time.

579
00:43:13.023 --> 00:43:14.924
Darn it.

580
00:43:14.925 --> 00:43:16.632
Get them.

581
00:44:15.519 --> 00:44:18.821
Tell me the truth if you wish to live.

582
00:44:18.822 --> 00:44:22.827
Was it Kim Ja-heon that
ordered Gong-gu killed?

583
00:44:25.429 --> 00:44:27.997
Was it Kim Ja-heon?

584
00:44:27.998 --> 00:44:29.999
Answer me.

585
00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:32.702
Master knows nothing of it.

586
00:44:32.703 --> 00:44:34.910
I killed Gong-gu out of my free will.

587
00:44:37.107 --> 00:44:40.810
Since when was he your master?

588
00:44:40.811 --> 00:44:43.413
Sa-hyeon.

589
00:44:43.414 --> 00:44:46.115
Do you know me?

590
00:44:46.116 --> 00:44:47.925
Don't move!

591
00:44:50.421 --> 00:44:53.423
For 10 years,

592
00:44:53.424 --> 00:44:57.429
not a day went by
without remembering that night.

593
00:44:59.430 --> 00:45:04.100
How you stabbed my father over and over...

594
00:45:04.101 --> 00:45:06.513
I remember clearly.

595
00:45:08.505 --> 00:45:13.511
But I never held grudge against you.

596
00:45:15.713 --> 00:45:20.924
Because I know that's
how you saved my life.

597
00:45:34.998 --> 00:45:38.002
I appreciate your forgiveness.

598
00:45:40.604 --> 00:45:41.104
<i>But...</i>

599
00:45:44.608 --> 00:45:48.021
I don't know what you're forgiving me for.

600
00:46:54.912 --> 00:46:57.518
<i>Jin-ok...</i>

601
00:47:00.217 --> 00:47:04.220
Jin-ok, wake up!

602
00:47:04.221 --> 00:47:06.724
What happened to her?

603
00:47:17.401 --> 00:47:19.702
How does it look?

604
00:47:19.703 --> 00:47:21.704
It's a deep cut.

605
00:47:21.705 --> 00:47:23.309
How deep?

606
00:47:25.709 --> 00:47:29.011
How deep?

607
00:47:29.012 --> 00:47:33.017
Very... very deep.

608
00:47:36.119 --> 00:47:38.020
Boil some water
and grind some salt to fine grains.

609
00:47:38.021 --> 00:47:40.223
Light up some charcoal.
Get plenty pine nuts.

610
00:47:40.224 --> 00:47:41.724
Before that, mix some red lay with water.

611
00:47:41.725 --> 00:47:42.925
You need the clear water on top.

612
00:47:42.926 --> 00:47:43.926
So, don't shake the bowl.

613
00:47:43.927 --> 00:47:46.529
Also, look for some dandelion and...

614
00:47:46.530 --> 00:47:49.398
Slow down, will you?

615
00:47:49.399 --> 00:47:53.402
Especially at a time like this.

616
00:47:53.403 --> 00:47:55.404
What was it again?

617
00:47:55.405 --> 00:47:57.715
Grind some salt, pine nuts...

618
00:48:53.497 --> 00:48:58.497
I solemnly pledge under these clouds,

619
00:48:58.902 --> 00:49:02.907
that we shall die together on the same day.

620
00:49:04.308 --> 00:49:06.208
No, this isn't right.

621
00:49:06.209 --> 00:49:10.214
It has to be more soppy and sweet.

622
00:49:13.617 --> 00:49:15.619
Hey, $a-hyeon!

623
00:49:20.424 --> 00:49:23.326
He's getting more perfect by day.

624
00:49:23.327 --> 00:49:25.528
Gorgeous!

625
00:49:25.529 --> 00:49:29.500
Let's die on the same day.

626
00:49:29.599 --> 00:49:31.010
No, this isn't it.

627
00:49:32.002 --> 00:49:36.806
I solemnly pledge under these clouds

628
00:49:36.807 --> 00:49:41.410
that my heart for you will never change.

629
00:49:41.411 --> 00:49:46.411
Even after the clouds drift
away and rocks roll,

630
00:49:46.416 --> 00:49:51.416
I will never forget this promise.

631
00:49:52.122 --> 00:49:53.422
Did you write it all down?

632
00:49:53.423 --> 00:49:54.423
Yes, miss.

633
00:49:54.424 --> 00:49:57.126
Write your name at the bottom.

634
00:49:57.127 --> 00:50:01.701
"Sa-hyeon"

635
00:50:02.399 --> 00:50:03.899
And this is for you.

636
00:50:03.900 --> 00:50:06.502
It's a dagger.

637
00:50:06.503 --> 00:50:08.504
I asked my father to have it

638
00:50:08.505 --> 00:50:12.008
made by the top sword maker.

639
00:50:12.009 --> 00:50:14.110
From now, you must use
this beautiful dagger

640
00:50:14.111 --> 00:50:16.312
to protect this beautiful girl that is me.

641
00:50:16.313 --> 00:50:18.814
Understood?

642
00:50:18.815 --> 00:50:20.316
Pardon?
What?

643
00:50:20.317 --> 00:50:22.319
You don't want to?

644
00:50:26.823 --> 00:50:30.526
Give me the names of the envoys
dispatched to Qing.

645
00:50:30.527 --> 00:50:33.329
Will you really have me cut off

646
00:50:33.330 --> 00:50:35.003
your little girl's fingers?

647
00:50:37.901 --> 00:50:39.402
Jin-ok!

648
00:50:39.403 --> 00:50:40.803
Father...

649
00:50:40.804 --> 00:50:44.013
Tell me! Where's the list?

650
00:50:53.016 --> 00:50:55.519
Father!

651
00:50:58.922 --> 00:51:02.024
Run, miss!

652
00:51:02.025 --> 00:51:03.629
Hurry!

653
00:51:04.728 --> 00:51:07.106
You sneaky little rat!

654
00:51:14.104 --> 00:51:16.209
Sa-hyeon!

655
00:51:42.299 --> 00:51:46.302
The sworn enemy that killed my father

656
00:51:46.303 --> 00:51:50.306
and took everything from me

657
00:51:50.307 --> 00:51:52.617
was Kim Ja-heon.

658
00:51:54.911 --> 00:51:59.911
I swore to myself everyday
to have my revenge one day

659
00:52:02.719 --> 00:52:06.722
but when I saw him again,

660
00:52:06.723 --> 00:52:08.532
I froze.

661
00:52:11.828 --> 00:52:15.598
I wasn't able to draw my sword.

662
00:52:15.599 --> 00:52:17.199
Let's go.

663
00:52:17.200 --> 00:52:19.301
And I wondered just when
you would say that.

664
00:52:19.302 --> 00:52:21.403
I can't stand it anymore.

665
00:52:21.404 --> 00:52:24.807
Let's go crush that jerk to pieces.

666
00:52:24.808 --> 00:52:28.517
Crushing or ripping him
apart, go by yourself.

667
00:52:30.814 --> 00:52:32.414
What are you saying?

668
00:52:32.415 --> 00:52:35.521
It's late. Enough for now.

669
00:52:54.404 --> 00:52:56.505
You're the youngest of us.

670
00:52:56.506 --> 00:52:59.909
Yet, you have grown so much.

671
00:52:59.910 --> 00:53:02.811
There must have been times
that you wanted to lean on us.

672
00:53:02.812 --> 00:53:06.817
But we never gave you the
chance to be the baby.

673
00:53:08.418 --> 00:53:10.319
After we finish this job,

674
00:53:10.320 --> 00:53:15.320
I'll be a good big sister.

675
00:53:15.525 --> 00:53:17.630
I'm sorry, Ga-bi.

676
00:53:23.900 --> 00:53:25.401
My poor baby...

677
00:53:25.402 --> 00:53:30.408
Your feet are swollen so badly.

678
00:53:34.110 --> 00:53:36.912
What are you mumbling about?

679
00:53:36.913 --> 00:53:39.715
Who are you?
It's Ga-bi.

680
00:53:39.716 --> 00:53:41.917
Then who the heck is this?

681
00:53:41.918 --> 00:53:44.420
Can I get some water?

682
00:53:44.421 --> 00:53:48.426
What's this jerk doing lying next to me?

683
00:53:48.625 --> 00:53:50.226
You son of a witch!

684
00:53:50.227 --> 00:53:51.427
Have you lost your mind?

685
00:53:51.428 --> 00:53:53.696
Who are you throwing rocks at?

686
00:53:53.697 --> 00:53:55.404
Just go back to sleep.

687
00:53:58.301 --> 00:54:00.402
Are you all right?

688
00:54:00.403 --> 00:54:04.406
That must've hurt.

689
00:54:04.407 --> 00:54:07.509
No biggie. That's just life.

690
00:54:07.510 --> 00:54:12.823
What a sight!

691
00:54:14.718 --> 00:54:16.418
Gosh!

692
00:54:16.419 --> 00:54:18.320
It's my husband's exam day.

693
00:54:18.321 --> 00:54:21.523
I can't believe I totally
forgot about that.

694
00:54:21.524 --> 00:54:25.028
Ga-bi, tell Jin-ok that I had to go home.

695
00:54:27.197 --> 00:54:29.898
She is really something, isn't she?

696
00:54:29.899 --> 00:54:33.602
Weird witch...

697
00:54:33.603 --> 00:54:35.204
What about me?

698
00:54:35.205 --> 00:54:37.106
What about you?

699
00:54:37.107 --> 00:54:38.707
What do you think of me?

700
00:54:38.708 --> 00:54:42.713
What do you mean what? You're just pretty.

701
00:54:47.517 --> 00:54:49.218
This isn't...

702
00:54:49.219 --> 00:54:51.920
You know...

703
00:54:51.921 --> 00:54:54.026
You've never done it before?

704
00:54:58.628 --> 00:55:01.905
Come on, do you know how old I am?

705
00:55:05.101 --> 00:55:07.603
No, I've never done it.

706
00:55:07.604 --> 00:55:09.015
What about you?

707
00:55:29.326 --> 00:55:31.327
That felt awesome.

708
00:55:31.328 --> 00:55:33.595
Then, I'll do it again.

709
00:55:33.596 --> 00:55:36.202
Isn't this little too fast?

710
00:55:43.807 --> 00:55:46.809
Who killed Gong-gu, then?

711
00:55:46.810 --> 00:55:49.111
It was Kim Ja-heon.

712
00:55:49.112 --> 00:55:53.015
It was Kim's men that chased Sir Gong-gu

713
00:55:53.016 --> 00:55:56.518
and assassinated him.

714
00:55:56.519 --> 00:56:00.522
I know because I suffered
under their swords, too.

715
00:56:00.523 --> 00:56:02.925
It's merely a statement, not an evidence.

716
00:56:02.926 --> 00:56:05.828
If I offer you Gong-gu's
stauroscope as evidence,

717
00:56:05.829 --> 00:56:07.496
will you believe me?

718
00:56:07.497 --> 00:56:09.198
Did you find it?

719
00:56:09.199 --> 00:56:10.599
Without a doubt.

720
00:56:10.600 --> 00:56:12.601
It's not something that should be
kept in anyone's possession.

721
00:56:12.602 --> 00:56:13.502
Hand it over to me.

722
00:56:13.503 --> 00:56:16.405
I will,

723
00:56:16.406 --> 00:56:19.910
under one condition.

724
00:56:23.813 --> 00:56:28.819
Is he practicing levitation?

725
00:56:30.220 --> 00:56:32.421
You! Come out.

726
00:56:32.422 --> 00:56:37.226
Mama, I didn't eat it, I swear.

727
00:56:37.227 --> 00:56:39.228
What a character!

728
00:56:39.229 --> 00:56:41.505
Wipe the saliva off your face.

729
00:56:46.202 --> 00:56:48.904
Is this the day that my
head drops to the ground?

730
00:56:48.905 --> 00:56:51.206
How meaningless life is!

731
00:56:51.207 --> 00:56:53.008
Come on! I'm busy.

732
00:56:53.009 --> 00:56:55.711
How can you be so heartless

733
00:56:55.712 --> 00:56:58.013
to someone who is about to die?

734
00:56:58.014 --> 00:56:58.814
What?

735
00:56:58.815 --> 00:57:01.417
Still, I hold no grudge for you.

736
00:57:01.418 --> 00:57:04.319
I have forgiven everyone.

737
00:57:04.320 --> 00:57:05.921
Eventually, it all comes down

738
00:57:05.922 --> 00:57:07.923
to forgiveness and love.

739
00:57:07.924 --> 00:57:11.929
Sure. Be a good man and hurry up.

740
00:57:17.100 --> 00:57:20.402
What's the time anyway?

741
00:57:20.403 --> 00:57:22.104
I'm feeling peckish. It
must be almost meal time.

742
00:57:22.105 --> 00:57:23.705
Get out of there. Come on.

743
00:57:23.706 --> 00:57:26.308
My girls should be visiting me soon.

744
00:57:26.309 --> 00:57:30.314
I'm sorry but can we postpone for tomorrow?

745
00:57:30.513 --> 00:57:31.413
It's freezing.

746
00:57:31.414 --> 00:57:35.017
Are you kidding me?
Come on, we haven't got all day.

747
00:57:35.018 --> 00:57:36.929
What's that over there?
What?

748
00:57:38.922 --> 00:57:41.523
It wasn't me, okay? I didn't kill that man.

749
00:57:41.524 --> 00:57:43.625
My girls will clear my name.

750
00:57:43.626 --> 00:57:45.627
Are you trying to get
yourself in a big trouble?

751
00:57:45.628 --> 00:57:46.428
Open this up now.

752
00:57:46.429 --> 00:57:47.596
You'll kill me if I open it, won't you?

753
00:57:47.597 --> 00:57:50.799
<i>I'm going to...</i>

754
00:57:50.800 --> 00:57:54.102
A royal decree was issued
ordering your release.

755
00:57:54.103 --> 00:57:56.405
Royal decree?

756
00:57:56.406 --> 00:57:57.606
You mean from the King?

757
00:57:57.607 --> 00:57:59.708
Of course, royal decree is from King.

758
00:57:59.709 --> 00:58:03.712
Who else could issue a royal decree?

759
00:58:03.713 --> 00:58:06.421
Open this up, now...

760
00:58:13.523 --> 00:58:16.129
Get moving.

761
00:58:25.602 --> 00:58:30.415
It won't be a breeze, this one.

762
00:58:32.108 --> 00:58:34.520
What shall I take this time?

763
00:58:39.015 --> 00:58:41.617
What will you do when you meet Kim Ja-heon?

764
00:58:41.618 --> 00:58:43.819
I don't know.

765
00:58:43.820 --> 00:58:45.621
I'm thinking.

766
00:58:45.622 --> 00:58:46.822
Still thinking?

767
00:58:46.823 --> 00:58:50.526
Jin-ok, what's this?

768
00:58:50.527 --> 00:58:53.695
What is it?
It's soft.

769
00:58:53.696 --> 00:58:55.300
And mushy.

770
00:59:17.420 --> 00:59:20.322
Byeokrando, Joseon's
only international port.

771
00:59:20.323 --> 00:59:21.723
It's an international trade capital

772
00:59:21.724 --> 00:59:25.027
where Chinese, Japanese,
Westerners even the Moors come.

773
00:59:25.028 --> 00:59:28.999
It's the only territory
outside of Joseon's jurisdiction.

774
00:59:56.526 --> 00:59:59.428
Master, we'll soon be
arriving in Byeokrando.

775
00:59:59.429 --> 01:00:01.396
Please ready yourself.

776
01:00:01.397 --> 01:00:03.104
Good.

777
01:01:03.426 --> 01:01:08.398
Can you stop fidgeting for crying out loud?

778
01:01:10.600 --> 01:01:13.513
You see that? That's my girls!

779
01:01:15.805 --> 01:01:16.905
What's that on your back?

780
01:01:16.906 --> 01:01:19.307
Aren't you a curious, old chap?

781
01:01:19.308 --> 01:01:22.010
It's a messenger pigeon.

782
01:01:22.011 --> 01:01:25.213
I thought they used falcons for messengers.

783
01:01:25.214 --> 01:01:28.417
Falcons are used by the army.

784
01:01:28.418 --> 01:01:31.219
We, the police force use pigeons, okay?

785
01:01:31.220 --> 01:01:32.824
Next!

786
01:01:33.923 --> 01:01:36.425
What's your business here?

787
01:01:36.426 --> 01:01:39.828
We are here to fight in the game.

788
01:01:39.829 --> 01:01:41.196
You're a contender?

789
01:01:41.197 --> 01:01:43.699
What do you mean by that?

790
01:01:43.700 --> 01:01:46.112
What's talking about?

791
01:01:49.305 --> 01:01:51.106
Something doesn't feel right with you.

792
01:01:51.107 --> 01:01:53.108
I'm the warrior.

793
01:01:53.109 --> 01:01:55.214
I'm a fighter of...

794
01:01:58.114 --> 01:01:59.414
Taekkyeon?
That's right!

795
01:01:59.415 --> 01:02:01.616
I'm a Taekkeyon player.

796
01:02:01.617 --> 01:02:04.119
You see?

797
01:02:04.120 --> 01:02:05.827
All right.

798
01:02:15.898 --> 01:02:17.499
Name, Maeong Gyo-gak.

799
01:02:17.500 --> 01:02:21.505
He is the architect
who designed Kim Ja-heon's pavilion.

800
01:02:21.704 --> 01:02:25.707
We must find out
if he had the blue print of the pavilion.

801
01:02:25.708 --> 01:02:27.119
<i>What the...</i>

802
01:02:31.214 --> 01:02:32.914
Look where you're going.

803
01:02:32.915 --> 01:02:34.019
"Blueprint"

804
01:02:35.618 --> 01:02:38.019
Once Jin-ok confirms the blueprint,

805
01:02:38.020 --> 01:02:40.330
Ga-bi, you got to distract his men.

806
01:02:41.524 --> 01:02:43.825
Excuse me...

807
01:02:43.826 --> 01:02:46.027
What about the blueprint?

808
01:02:46.028 --> 01:02:47.896
I will take care of that!

809
01:02:47.897 --> 01:02:50.098
You concentrate on your job.

810
01:02:50.099 --> 01:02:52.705
I feel dizzy...

811
01:02:54.103 --> 01:02:57.906
on, I'm dizzy...

812
01:02:57.907 --> 01:02:59.818
There he comes.

813
01:03:07.717 --> 01:03:10.630
Dizzy... darn it!

814
01:03:16.726 --> 01:03:19.036
Ga-bi? Ga-bi!

815
01:05:11.707 --> 01:05:12.908
Here.

816
01:05:12.909 --> 01:05:16.211
There are two secret rooms.

817
01:05:16.212 --> 01:05:18.113
One is located on 7th floor of the pavilion

818
01:05:18.114 --> 01:05:21.316
and the other is in the basement.

819
01:05:21.317 --> 01:05:22.617
Wait... where and where again?

820
01:05:22.618 --> 01:05:25.020
Focus, please?

821
01:05:25.021 --> 01:05:27.126
It's because I have water in my ears.

822
01:05:29.225 --> 01:05:31.326
There are two ways to get to
the secret room on the 7th.

823
01:05:31.327 --> 01:05:34.696
Through the central stairway

824
01:05:34.697 --> 01:05:37.098
and the ventilation shaft.

825
01:05:37.099 --> 01:05:38.510
Ventilation shaft?

826
01:05:41.003 --> 01:05:44.212
Ga-bi, you should take the vent to the top.

827
01:05:47.009 --> 01:05:48.710
I'll infiltrate through the iron mill

828
01:05:48.711 --> 01:05:51.813
to the secret room in the basement.

829
01:05:51.814 --> 01:05:53.114
What about me?

830
01:05:53.115 --> 01:05:57.120
You take the stairs up to the 7th floor.

831
01:06:17.506 --> 01:06:19.307
Hey, you!

832
01:06:19.308 --> 01:06:21.509
Good heavens! You scared me.

833
01:06:21.510 --> 01:06:23.012
Come here.

834
01:06:28.718 --> 01:06:33.718
Are you the only boys here?

835
01:06:34.623 --> 01:06:36.124
Yes. Who are you?

836
01:06:36.125 --> 01:06:37.726
I'm Hong-dan.

837
01:06:37.727 --> 01:06:40.095
Hong-dan?

838
01:06:40.096 --> 01:06:41.896
Enemy alert!

839
01:06:41.897 --> 01:06:43.398
Shut up...

840
01:06:43.399 --> 01:06:44.799
I said shut up.

841
01:06:44.800 --> 01:06:48.805
How many times did I tell you?

842
01:07:12.428 --> 01:07:16.399
Meeting you made this journey worthwhile.

843
01:07:18.401 --> 01:07:22.003
Is it true that you have in custody

844
01:07:22.004 --> 01:07:25.006
the man who stole our military map?

845
01:07:25.007 --> 01:07:26.107
That's right.

846
01:07:26.108 --> 01:07:28.209
If you can prove

847
01:07:28.210 --> 01:07:32.215
Joseon King's treacherous
plans to the Emperor,

848
01:07:32.415 --> 01:07:36.420
I'll give you Joseon as I promised.

849
01:07:41.824 --> 01:07:44.826
The gunpowder and weaponry I brought

850
01:07:44.827 --> 01:07:47.395
will be the gift of proof.

851
01:07:47.396 --> 01:07:49.798
I shall be looking forward to it.

852
01:07:49.799 --> 01:07:52.507
So, where is the man?

853
01:07:56.906 --> 01:08:00.513
Qing's envoy has finally come for you.

854
01:08:09.819 --> 01:08:13.323
Don't you wish to live?

855
01:08:21.897 --> 01:08:25.401
Stauroscope, where are you?

856
01:08:29.105 --> 01:08:31.107
How do you open this?

857
01:08:46.522 --> 01:08:49.424
Good heavens!

858
01:08:49.425 --> 01:08:54.101
This is how my life takes a new turn.

859
01:09:06.208 --> 01:09:10.213
Are you going to throw that at me?

860
01:09:11.313 --> 01:09:15.318
You scared me.

861
01:09:15.518 --> 01:09:20.524
Ga-bi, I'm rich now.

862
01:09:24.627 --> 01:09:26.694
Look at all these.

863
01:09:26.695 --> 01:09:31.804
I've really become rich.

864
01:09:32.902 --> 01:09:36.004
Okay, pass...

865
01:09:36.005 --> 01:09:38.506
Who the heck are you?

866
01:09:38.507 --> 01:09:40.714
Where did the fatty go?

867
01:09:46.515 --> 01:09:48.616
You must win this round.

868
01:09:48.617 --> 01:09:50.426
Sure...

869
01:09:52.321 --> 01:09:54.733
Because of the darn fatty!

870
01:09:57.426 --> 01:09:59.327
What are you doing?

871
01:09:59.328 --> 01:10:00.695
I scattered the gunpowder.

872
01:10:00.696 --> 01:10:03.108
So, I'm going to light up the place.

873
01:10:05.201 --> 01:10:08.808
Who are you trying to fry?

874
01:10:10.506 --> 01:10:15.506
Stop it! Don't do it until I've evacuated.

875
01:10:17.513 --> 01:10:19.515
Send it up in flames.

876
01:10:21.116 --> 01:10:23.528
Let's light it up and go together.

877
01:10:26.121 --> 01:10:29.224
Won't you listen to me?

878
01:10:29.225 --> 01:10:32.227
This is my expertise.

879
01:10:32.228 --> 01:10:34.504
Don't you trust me?

880
01:10:39.101 --> 01:10:41.502
I don't.

881
01:10:41.503 --> 01:10:44.416
Then, that's the end of the story.

882
01:10:48.711 --> 01:10:54.821
Next is the Joseon's best Taekkyeon artist.

883
01:10:56.518 --> 01:10:58.620
What did you say your name was?

884
01:10:58.621 --> 01:11:00.021
It's Dawn Song.

885
01:11:00.022 --> 01:11:03.124
Dawn? As in morning, afternoon and evening?

886
01:11:03.125 --> 01:11:04.525
Show some respect. It's my name!

887
01:11:04.526 --> 01:11:09.407
Dawn Song!

888
01:11:13.302 --> 01:11:15.003
Place your bets.

889
01:11:15.004 --> 01:11:19.009
They recognize me? I can't blow my cover.

890
01:11:23.412 --> 01:11:27.417
You got to be kidding me!

891
01:11:29.718 --> 01:11:32.420
How old are you?

892
01:11:32.421 --> 01:11:34.822
This is no place for a
pretty girl like you.

893
01:11:34.823 --> 01:11:39.327
Do you know how dangerous this place is?

894
01:11:39.328 --> 01:11:42.297
Where are your parents?

895
01:11:42.298 --> 01:11:44.403
Over there.
Where?

896
01:11:52.007 --> 01:11:53.908
Don't be a pussy.

897
01:11:53.909 --> 01:11:56.321
Get back on your feet.

898
01:11:58.213 --> 01:12:00.523
Oh, man!

899
01:12:02.318 --> 01:12:05.822
What's he doing there?

900
01:12:08.524 --> 01:12:12.327
Are you enjoying the game?

901
01:12:12.328 --> 01:12:15.096
Yes, it's entertaining.

902
01:12:15.097 --> 01:12:19.102
But I would rather be meeting
that man right now.

903
01:12:19.301 --> 01:12:21.903
There's no rush.

904
01:12:21.904 --> 01:12:24.111
Just sit back and relax.

905
01:12:27.309 --> 01:12:29.711
I said bring him to me.

906
01:12:29.712 --> 01:12:31.714
Right now!

907
01:12:35.718 --> 01:12:38.019
Why isn't Jo Yu-sik here yet?

908
01:12:38.020 --> 01:12:40.432
I'll find out, my lord.

909
01:12:45.327 --> 01:12:48.696
Just do as you're told, okay?

910
01:12:48.697 --> 01:12:53.601
Tell the Qing envoy everything you know.

911
01:12:53.602 --> 01:12:57.607
And I'll take you to your daughter.

912
01:12:59.508 --> 01:13:02.510
Let me see my daughter.

913
01:13:02.511 --> 01:13:06.214
Let me see her first.

914
01:13:06.215 --> 01:13:10.218
Damned stubborn man!

915
01:13:10.219 --> 01:13:13.821
Do you want me to bring her here
and have her head chopped off?

916
01:13:13.822 --> 01:13:15.823
Is that what you want?

917
01:13:15.824 --> 01:13:18.532
You'll have your wish then, Jo Yu-sik!

918
01:13:20.295 --> 01:13:21.796
Jo Yu-sik.

919
01:13:21.797 --> 01:13:23.297
What's it going to be?

920
01:13:23.298 --> 01:13:27.301
Will you confess to the Qing envoy?

921
01:13:27.302 --> 01:13:30.705
<i>Jin-ok...</i>

922
01:13:30.706 --> 01:13:35.706
I'll do anything you say.

923
01:13:35.911 --> 01:13:39.414
Please don't hurt my daughter.

924
01:13:39.415 --> 01:13:41.516
Father...

925
01:13:41.517 --> 01:13:44.419
I beg of you, please.

926
01:13:44.420 --> 01:13:46.923
Father...

927
01:13:54.897 --> 01:13:56.899
Who are you?

928
01:13:58.300 --> 01:14:00.906
I asked you a question.

929
01:14:11.413 --> 01:14:13.620
<i>What the...</i>

930
01:14:43.812 --> 01:14:46.725
Jin-ok, is that really you?

931
01:14:48.116 --> 01:14:51.519
Yes, father.

932
01:14:51.520 --> 01:14:57.334
It's your daughter, Jin-ok.

933
01:15:18.413 --> 01:15:19.025
<i>Jin-ok...</i>

934
01:15:31.026 --> 01:15:33.597
Yes, father.

935
01:15:45.807 --> 01:15:48.209
You filthy monster!

936
01:15:48.210 --> 01:15:52.213
How can you do this to a man?

937
01:15:52.214 --> 01:15:57.027
I'll do exactly the same to you.

938
01:16:05.727 --> 01:16:08.195
I see that you're not dead.

939
01:16:08.196 --> 01:16:10.298
I had no reason to be.

940
01:16:10.299 --> 01:16:12.600
You don't need a particular reason to die.

941
01:16:12.601 --> 01:16:17.601
I need to know why you changed like this

942
01:16:18.407 --> 01:16:20.910
and what happened to my father.

943
01:16:23.211 --> 01:16:25.212
That man is your father?

944
01:16:25.213 --> 01:16:30.117
I don't understand and
neither does my father.

945
01:16:30.118 --> 01:16:31.719
What happened to you?

946
01:16:31.720 --> 01:16:36.720
I said I didn't know
because I don't know you.

947
01:16:37.526 --> 01:16:42.526
You deny me and yourself to the end.

948
01:16:43.799 --> 01:16:50.114
Even so, how is that a
reason that you can't die.

949
01:17:03.018 --> 01:17:06.329
Why aren't you attacking me?

950
01:17:33.815 --> 01:17:35.726
Man, this is hard.

951
01:17:38.320 --> 01:17:40.521
Did you light up the wick?

952
01:17:40.522 --> 01:17:42.229
Yes.

953
01:17:43.225 --> 01:17:46.794
It'll give us some time?

954
01:17:46.795 --> 01:17:47.995
Nope.

955
01:17:47.996 --> 01:17:49.196
Then, when does it blow?

956
01:17:49.197 --> 01:17:50.598
Now.

957
01:17:50.599 --> 01:17:52.806
I swear I'll kill you.

958
01:18:06.014 --> 01:18:08.221
My girls caused trouble again.

959
01:18:13.021 --> 01:18:16.123
Didn't I tell you be careful?

960
01:18:16.124 --> 01:18:18.726
Do you want us get killed?

961
01:18:18.727 --> 01:18:22.698
Well, we're alive.

962
01:18:24.199 --> 01:18:26.805
I swear I'll kill you with these hands.

963
01:18:30.505 --> 01:18:32.206
What's going on?

964
01:18:32.207 --> 01:18:33.607
It's probably nothing.

965
01:18:33.608 --> 01:18:36.020
Please don't be alarmed.

966
01:18:39.915 --> 01:18:43.328
Where is Sa-hyeon?

967
01:19:07.709 --> 01:19:12.709
She says she is Jo Yu-sik's daughter.

968
01:19:13.615 --> 01:19:18.419
So, that little girl survived.

969
01:19:18.420 --> 01:19:22.723
Yes, after enduring all these years,

970
01:19:22.724 --> 01:19:25.432
I finally get to see you again.

971
01:19:29.297 --> 01:19:34.297
This truly is an ill-fated relationship.

972
01:19:34.503 --> 01:19:37.505
Don't be so sure.

973
01:19:37.506 --> 01:19:42.506
Because I'll show what
ill-fated really means.

974
01:19:46.014 --> 01:19:49.617
You really are the child of Jo Yu-sik.

975
01:19:49.618 --> 01:19:53.623
But I just don't have time for you.

976
01:19:53.822 --> 01:19:55.823
Come over here.

977
01:19:55.824 --> 01:20:00.594
I offer a reward of 1,000
gold coins on her head.

978
01:20:00.595 --> 01:20:02.096
Kill her!

979
01:20:02.097 --> 01:20:04.304
Kill her...

980
01:20:19.815 --> 01:20:22.316
Why did you keep her alive?

981
01:20:22.317 --> 01:20:24.718
You did it on purpose?

982
01:20:24.719 --> 01:20:29.123
I don't understand what you mean, sir.

983
01:20:29.124 --> 01:20:34.124
Did the old memories come back?

984
01:20:35.797 --> 01:20:39.200
I'll keep a eye on you

985
01:20:39.201 --> 01:20:42.808
see whose dog you really are.

986
01:20:47.409 --> 01:20:53.121
I almost forgot.

987
01:20:58.920 --> 01:21:03.835
I've been meaning to give this to you.

988
01:21:30.719 --> 01:21:34.221
Stolen dogs will bite its new owner,

989
01:21:34.222 --> 01:21:37.324
when it's reunited with its old master.

990
01:21:37.325 --> 01:21:39.994
I've had a good use of you

991
01:21:39.995 --> 01:21:42.999
now go back you old master.

992
01:22:19.200 --> 01:22:22.204
Did you get the dagger?

993
01:22:24.606 --> 01:22:27.408
Should Jin-ok ever be in
danger because of me,

994
01:22:27.409 --> 01:22:30.110
you shall stab me with that dagger.

995
01:22:30.111 --> 01:22:35.527
I remember you stabbing
my father over and over.

996
01:22:38.720 --> 01:22:41.822
That will be the only way to save her.

997
01:22:41.823 --> 01:22:43.624
Understood?

998
01:22:43.625 --> 01:22:47.004
I don't understand neither does my father.

999
01:22:48.396 --> 01:22:49.500
Come on, miss. Hurry!

1000
01:22:53.601 --> 01:22:55.803
Sa-hyeon!

1001
01:22:55.804 --> 01:22:59.616
I'm sorry I wasn't able to protect you.

1002
01:23:18.426 --> 01:23:19.727
Father.

1003
01:23:19.728 --> 01:23:22.596
Look up at the front.

1004
01:23:22.597 --> 01:23:24.804
That's only way you save yourself.

1005
01:24:53.021 --> 01:24:54.523
Father!

1006
01:24:57.525 --> 01:24:59.326
Don't try anything.

1007
01:24:59.327 --> 01:25:01.102
Stand back.

1008
01:25:02.797 --> 01:25:04.504
I said stand back!

1009
01:25:16.711 --> 01:25:20.215
If the walls collapse, we'll all die.

1010
01:25:21.516 --> 01:25:23.016
We must leave at once.

1011
01:25:23.017 --> 01:25:24.818
What happened to you?

1012
01:25:24.819 --> 01:25:27.121
Are you going to kill your father?

1013
01:25:27.122 --> 01:25:29.124
We got to go now!

1014
01:26:24.913 --> 01:26:27.018
Come on out.

1015
01:27:03.518 --> 01:27:05.429
Stop trying. Get out now.

1016
01:27:07.622 --> 01:27:09.932
I said that's enough.

1017
01:27:13.995 --> 01:27:15.395
Get out of here.

1018
01:27:15.396 --> 01:27:18.098
Do you want us both to die here?

1019
01:27:18.099 --> 01:27:20.400
We can both live.

1020
01:27:20.401 --> 01:27:22.312
We'll make it out together.

1021
01:27:24.005 --> 01:27:26.707
Listen to me carefully.

1022
01:27:26.708 --> 01:27:29.910
I don't know you.

1023
01:27:29.911 --> 01:27:33.013
I don't know how you know me from the past

1024
01:27:33.014 --> 01:27:35.515
but I don't know you.

1025
01:27:35.516 --> 01:27:38.725
I remember clearly.

1026
01:27:40.922 --> 01:27:45.922
I can tell when I look into your eyes.

1027
01:27:47.295 --> 01:27:51.898
So, don't you give up.

1028
01:27:51.899 --> 01:27:53.503
Pull yourself up.

1029
01:27:57.105 --> 01:27:59.006
Get up here.

1030
01:27:59.007 --> 01:28:01.009
Now!

1031
01:28:08.216 --> 01:28:09.820
Hold my hand.

1032
01:28:11.219 --> 01:28:13.426
Hold my hand!

1033
01:28:18.126 --> 01:28:20.606
Come on!

1034
01:28:30.405 --> 01:28:34.410
You must protect me with
this pretty dagger, okay?

1035
01:28:34.609 --> 01:28:36.410
Understand?

1036
01:28:36.411 --> 01:28:40.416
You must keep this promise.

1037
01:28:45.520 --> 01:28:47.329
Hurry LIP-

1038
01:28:49.724 --> 01:28:51.224
What are you doing?

1039
01:28:51.225 --> 01:28:53.493
No!

1040
01:28:53.494 --> 01:28:55.896
You promised me.

1041
01:28:55.897 --> 01:28:59.499
You promised that you'd protect me.

1042
01:28:59.500 --> 01:29:03.804
Please, Sa-hyeon. Hold my hand.

1043
01:29:03.805 --> 01:29:07.708
Please! Hold my hand.

1044
01:29:07.709 --> 01:29:12.709
It's not in my memories
but that promise I made you...

1045
01:29:12.814 --> 01:29:15.920
I may be able to keep it.

1046
01:29:25.526 --> 01:29:28.507
Sa-hyeon!

1047
01:29:34.802 --> 01:29:37.408
Sa-hyeon!

1048
01:29:39.407 --> 01:29:41.819
Sa-hyeon!

1049
01:30:10.505 --> 01:30:13.816
You're one persistent witch!

1050
01:30:20.515 --> 01:30:22.215
He's getting away.

1051
01:30:22.216 --> 01:30:25.619
Come back here!
Stop right there, you jerk!

1052
01:30:25.620 --> 01:30:27.421
Come back here.

1053
01:30:27.422 --> 01:30:30.631
Catch me if you can.

1054
01:30:35.696 --> 01:30:38.598
What are you going to do?

1055
01:30:38.599 --> 01:30:41.512
What are they trying to do?

1056
01:30:54.215 --> 01:30:57.317
<i>What the...</i>

1057
01:30:57.318 --> 01:30:59.719
Come on, girls! Turn the wheel.

1058
01:30:59.720 --> 01:31:01.822
Turn it...

1059
01:31:01.823 --> 01:31:03.323
What are you doing?

1060
01:31:03.324 --> 01:31:05.025
Shut up and give us a hand.

1061
01:31:05.026 --> 01:31:06.630
This?

1062
01:31:14.101 --> 01:31:15.705
<i>Shoot!</i>

1063
01:31:32.220 --> 01:31:34.020
<i>Shoot!</i>

1064
01:31:34.021 --> 01:31:37.224
Do something or she'll get killed.

1065
01:31:37.225 --> 01:31:39.535
I know that, too.

1066
01:31:40.595 --> 01:31:44.202
Move, fatty! ls there anything you can do?

1067
01:31:53.708 --> 01:31:55.813
Shoot her.

1068
01:32:13.227 --> 01:32:16.208
What are you doing? Shoot them.

1069
01:32:21.702 --> 01:32:23.203
Come on, turn it.

1070
01:32:23.204 --> 01:32:25.309
It's this way!

1071
01:32:53.601 --> 01:32:57.203
Hong-dan, hurry...

1072
01:32:57.204 --> 01:32:59.606
All right...

1073
01:32:59.607 --> 01:33:01.814
Come on. Do something.

1074
01:33:11.419 --> 01:33:12.919
Stop...

1075
01:33:12.920 --> 01:33:14.524
Slop?

1076
01:34:17.818 --> 01:34:19.525
Get her!

1077
01:34:25.026 --> 01:34:27.006
I said get her.

1078
01:34:43.411 --> 01:34:45.721
Ga-bi! You did great.

1079
01:34:47.715 --> 01:34:50.016
What did I tell you?

1080
01:34:50.017 --> 01:34:52.419
I said I'd never let you get away.

1081
01:34:52.420 --> 01:34:54.621
A lowly stupid girl

1082
01:34:54.622 --> 01:34:56.623
acting fearless relying on her sword.

1083
01:34:56.624 --> 01:35:00.593
Relying on my sword, did you say?

1084
01:35:00.594 --> 01:35:02.596
All right then.

1085
01:35:06.600 --> 01:35:10.303
How dare you trying to toy with me?

1086
01:35:10.304 --> 01:35:12.605
You're begging to be killed.

1087
01:35:12.606 --> 01:35:15.408
Should I crush you under my feet

1088
01:35:15.409 --> 01:35:17.821
or shred you to pieces...

1089
01:35:21.916 --> 01:35:24.123
Witch!

1090
01:35:28.022 --> 01:35:30.623
Keep babbling away.

1091
01:35:30.624 --> 01:35:34.595
Suddenly, you're out of things to say?

1092
01:35:35.896 --> 01:35:39.099
Conniving lying wretch like you

1093
01:35:39.100 --> 01:35:40.700
doesn't need a mouth.

1094
01:35:40.701 --> 01:35:42.602
From this day, you shall
shut that filthy mouth

1095
01:35:42.603 --> 01:35:46.312
and live quietly.

1096
01:35:56.917 --> 01:35:58.518
You who liaised with the enemies

1097
01:35:58.519 --> 01:36:01.020
and harmed King's faithful servants.

1098
01:36:01.021 --> 01:36:06.021
Threatened a father with
the life of his child,

1099
01:36:06.694 --> 01:36:10.997
tainted precious memories!

1100
01:36:10.998 --> 01:36:13.308
Lower than lowest of beasts!

1101
01:36:15.002 --> 01:36:17.312
I shall break the hand
that committed terrible deeds.

1102
01:36:19.907 --> 01:36:22.911
I shall crush the leg
that sold out your own country.

1103
01:36:26.113 --> 01:36:31.113
The eyes that look down
on people like animals...

1104
01:36:31.519 --> 01:36:33.521
Save me!

1105
01:36:38.726 --> 01:36:41.206
Show mercy!

1106
01:36:42.997 --> 01:36:50.997
Save me, please...

1107
01:36:56.510 --> 01:36:58.114
Please, I beg you.

1108
01:37:00.314 --> 01:37:04.017
How dare you do this to me?

1109
01:37:04.018 --> 01:37:09.832
I shall do exactly the same to you.

1110
01:37:18.199 --> 01:37:21.701
How does it feel to hold an empty gun?

1111
01:37:21.702 --> 01:37:24.003
Futile, isn't it?

1112
01:37:24.004 --> 01:37:29.004
That's what the power you
thought you had was like.

1113
01:37:29.109 --> 01:37:30.310
You'd calculate and calculate again,

1114
01:37:30.311 --> 01:37:32.912
kill or save people as you see fit

1115
01:37:32.913 --> 01:37:35.917
but it all comes down to an empty barrel.

1116
01:37:37.718 --> 01:37:41.723
I'll return the stauroscope
to its rightful owner.

1117
01:38:21.695 --> 01:38:24.107
What is this?

1118
01:38:52.026 --> 01:38:55.599
Where did it go? I must make report.

1119
01:39:07.908 --> 01:39:11.210
Hey...

1120
01:39:11.211 --> 01:39:13.713
The chief will kill me if
he doesn't hear from me.

1121
01:39:13.714 --> 01:39:15.014
What do I do now?

1122
01:39:15.015 --> 01:39:16.516
Hey, wake up!

1123
01:39:16.517 --> 01:39:18.418
Wakey, pigeon!

1124
01:39:18.419 --> 01:39:20.520
Come on, open your eyes.

1125
01:39:20.521 --> 01:39:23.024
Please! My life depends on you.

1126
01:39:29.496 --> 01:39:31.703
Wake up, please!

1127
01:39:43.711 --> 01:39:47.513
I hear that you performed
a brilliant exploit in Byeokrando.

1128
01:39:47.514 --> 01:39:51.519
I only did what my duties commanded.

1129
01:39:54.621 --> 01:39:59.621
Faithful servants,
you have saved this country from harm.

1130
01:40:00.794 --> 01:40:05.794
His Majesty wishes to recognize you
for your service.

1131
01:40:06.700 --> 01:40:11.700
Jo Yu-sik, is hereby appointed to
Minister of Defense

1132
01:40:13.307 --> 01:40:16.509
to be in charge of
defending this kingdom from enemies.

1133
01:40:16.510 --> 01:40:21.425
I will fulfill my duties
with honor, Your Majesty.

1134
01:40:24.518 --> 01:40:26.819
As for Mu Myeong...

1135
01:40:26.820 --> 01:40:30.825
Please have my master reinstated
upon completion of this mission.

1136
01:40:31.025 --> 01:40:34.996
I hereby restore you to
Chief of Investigation.

1137
01:40:37.498 --> 01:40:38.898
Next is Ahn Hong-dan...

1138
01:40:38.899 --> 01:40:41.000
Write off her family's debt

1139
01:40:41.001 --> 01:40:45.006
and gift her with a shop for
the family's livelihood.

1140
01:40:46.807 --> 01:40:48.207
Thank you!

1141
01:40:48.208 --> 01:40:50.410
I mean, Your grace is
immeasurable, Your Majesty.

1142
01:40:50.411 --> 01:40:52.412
As for Park Ga-bi...

1143
01:40:52.413 --> 01:40:53.513
She has an exceptional talent in

1144
01:40:53.514 --> 01:40:55.915
martial arts and military strategy.

1145
01:40:55.916 --> 01:40:58.017
If you train her academically, too,

1146
01:40:58.018 --> 01:41:00.931
she'll be a great service to this kingdom.

1147
01:41:09.997 --> 01:41:11.497
That was so uncomfortable.

1148
01:41:11.498 --> 01:41:14.200
His Majesty is such a
handsome man, isn't he?

1149
01:41:14.201 --> 01:41:15.601
How dare you!

1150
01:41:15.602 --> 01:41:16.803
What?

1151
01:41:16.804 --> 01:41:19.806
Who's the leader here?

1152
01:41:19.807 --> 01:41:21.507
Take this.

1153
01:41:21.508 --> 01:41:22.308
What is it?

1154
01:41:22.309 --> 01:41:24.414
Do you know a man called 'Chick'?

1155
01:41:27.915 --> 01:41:29.515
Name, Chick.

1156
01:41:29.516 --> 01:41:33.119
Reward 1,000 nyang.

1157
01:41:33.120 --> 01:41:35.521
If you get 1,000 nyang, 500 is mine.

1158
01:41:35.522 --> 01:41:36.722
What?

1159
01:41:36.723 --> 01:41:38.825
You became greedy ever
since you started dating.

1160
01:41:38.826 --> 01:41:41.394
Dating who? Tell me.

1161
01:41:41.395 --> 01:41:44.205
It's not Constable Song, is it?

1162
01:41:45.999 --> 01:41:49.001
Of all the men out there,
you had to pick him?

1163
01:41:49.002 --> 01:41:51.104
What's wrong with that?

1164
01:41:51.105 --> 01:41:52.405
It's between a man and a woman.

1165
01:41:52.406 --> 01:41:54.907
How did you get in here?

1166
01:41:54.908 --> 01:41:57.510
Are you crazy? Don't hit him!

1167
01:41:57.511 --> 01:41:59.616
Whose side are you on?

1168
01:42:01.615 --> 01:42:03.925
What's the matter with you two?

1169
01:42:22.102 --> 01:42:23.202
Sir.

1170
01:42:23.203 --> 01:42:24.504
What?
I found Chick.

1171
01:42:24.505 --> 01:42:27.106
Here we go on three. One, two...

1172
01:42:27.107 --> 01:42:28.814
Three!

1173
01:42:31.812 --> 01:42:35.615
I knew you'd come.

1174
01:42:35.616 --> 01:42:38.317
You're looking to get your life cut short.

1175
01:42:38.318 --> 01:42:40.423
We'll have to see about that.

1176
01:42:51.798 --> 01:42:54.200
You scumbags!

1177
01:42:54.201 --> 01:42:55.801
I, Mu Myeong is here!

1178
01:42:55.802 --> 01:42:58.604
Bring it on if you dare.

1179
01:42:58.605 --> 01:43:03.209
I'll crush you with the fist of justice.

1180
01:43:03.210 --> 01:43:05.811
Bring it on! Come on...

1181
01:43:05.812 --> 01:43:07.013
What's he doing?

1182
01:43:07.014 --> 01:43:09.315
Come on, get him!

1183
01:43:09.316 --> 01:43:11.523
Show me what you got...

1184
01:43:19.026 --> 01:43:22.895
Whoever catches him gets the reward.

1185
01:43:22.896 --> 01:43:26.399
No complaints about your shares, okay?

1186
01:43:26.400 --> 01:43:27.900
Fine by me.

1187
01:43:27.901 --> 01:43:30.002
Ready!

1188
01:43:30.003 --> 01:43:31.204
Just follow me.

1189
01:43:31.205 --> 01:43:32.805
You follow me.

1190
01:43:32.806 --> 01:43:34.513
Go!

1191
01:43:58.999 --> 01:44:03.505
"THE HUNTRESSES"
